        <!-- Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬ Page Footer Links Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬ -->
        <footer class="border-t border-slate-800 pt-6 pb-4 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 text-xs text-slate-400">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px]">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-emerald-500 text-[14px]">lock</span>
            <span data-i18n="paymentSecurityNote">Thanh toÃƒÂ¡n Ã„â€˜Ã†Â°Ã¡Â»Â£c bÃ¡ÂºÂ£o mÃ¡ÂºÂ­t vÃƒÂ  xÃ¡Â»Â­ lÃƒÂ½ thÃƒÂ´ng qua hÃ¡Â»â€¡ thÃ¡Â»â€˜ng VietQR.</span>
          </div>
