                <!-- Left Instructions & info Alert -->
                <div class="space-y-4 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
                  <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed" data-i18n="paymentInstructions">
                    QuÃƒÂ©t mÃƒÂ£ QR hoÃ¡ÂºÂ·c sÃ¡Â»Â­ dÃ¡Â»Â¥ng Ã¡Â»Â©ng dÃ¡Â»Â¥ng ngÃƒÂ¢n hÃƒÂ ng Ã„â€˜Ã¡Â»Æ’ thanh toÃƒÂ¡n.
                  </p>
                  <div class="text-base">
                    <span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-xs" data-i18n="amountToPay">SÃ¡Â»â€˜ tiÃ¡Â»Ân cÃ¡ÂºÂ§n thanh toÃƒÂ¡n:</span>
                    <span class="font-extrabold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 text-lg block mt-0.5" id="checkout-amount-val">5,000Ã„â€˜</span>
                  </div>

                  <!-- Info Alert container -->
                  <div class="bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-500/20 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-400 p-3 rounded-lg text-[11px] leading-normal flex items-start gap-2">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[15px] mt-0.5">info</span>
                    <span data-i18n="activationTimelineNote">Sau khi thanh toÃƒÂ¡n thÃƒÂ nh cÃƒÂ´ng, gÃƒÂ³i cÃ¡Â»Â§a bÃ¡ÂºÂ¡n sÃ¡ÂºÂ½ Ã„â€˜Ã†Â°Ã¡Â»Â£c kÃƒÂ­ch hoÃ¡ÂºÂ¡t tÃ¡Â»Â± Ã„â€˜Ã¡Â»â„¢ng trong vÃƒÂ²ng 1-3 phÃƒÂºt.</span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- QR Code view column -->
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-center space-y-3">
