                  </div>

                  <div class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/60 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 flex justify-between items-center text-[11px]">
                    <div>
                      <span class="text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 block text-[9px]" data-i18n="accountNumberLabel">SÃ¡Â»â€˜ tÃƒÂ i khoÃ¡ÂºÂ£n</span>
                      <strong class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 tracking-wider" id="checkout-account-val">--</strong>
                    </div>
                    <button type="button" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-500 dark:hover:text-blue-300 text-xs flex items-center gap-0.5" onclick="copyText('checkout-account-val')">
                      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[13px]">content_copy</span>
                    </button>
                  </div>

                  <div class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/60 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 flex justify-between items-center text-[11px]">
                    <div>
                      <span class="text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 block text-[9px]" data-i18n="accountNameLabel">ChÃ¡Â»Â§ tÃƒÂ i khoÃ¡ÂºÂ£n</span>
                      <strong class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200" id="checkout-holder-val">--</strong>
                    </div>
                    <button type="button" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-500 dark:hover:text-blue-300 text-xs flex items-center gap-0.5" onclick="copyText('checkout-holder-val')">
                      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[13px]">content_copy</span>
                    </button>
                  </div>

                  <div class="bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/20 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-900/50 flex justify-between items-center text-[11px]">
                    <div>
                      <span class="text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-400 block text-[9px]" data-i18n="transferMemoLabel">NÃ¡Â»â„¢i dung chuyÃ¡Â»Æ’n khoÃ¡ÂºÂ£n (BÃ¡ÂºÂ¯t buÃ¡Â»â„¢c Ã„â€˜ÃƒÂºng)</span>
